---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import ContactCta from "../components/ContactCta.astro";

const consultingJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "ProfessionalService",
  "@id": "https://maurizioturatti.com/#service",
  name: "Maurizio Turatti",
  image: "https://maurizioturatti.com/images/maurizio.jpeg",
  url: "https://maurizioturatti.com/",
  description:
    "Software architecture and technical leadership for teams that need to move fast. Hands-on work with Java, JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, MongoDB, AWS, API design.",
  areaServed: "Europe and North America",
  knowsAbout: [
    "Software Architecture",
    "Technical Leadership",
    "Backend Engineering",
    "Java",
    "MongoDB",
    "AWS",
    "REST API Design",
    "AI Integration"
  ],
};
---

<Base
  title="Software Architecture and Technical Leadership — Maurizio Turatti"
  description="Software architecture and technical leadership for teams that need to move fast. Hands-on work with Java, JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, MongoDB, AWS, API design."
  ogImage="/images/maurizio.jpeg"
  jsonLd={consultingJsonLd}
>
  <div class="hero hero--first">
    <h1 class="hero-headline">
      Software architecture and technical leadership for teams that need to move
      fast.
    </h1>
  </div>

  <div class="section-stack">
    <div class="section-block">
      <h2 class="section-title">What does this mean?</h2>
      <div class="section-body">
        <p>Depending on where you are:</p>
        <p>
          1. <strong>Your system doesn't scale:</strong> slow APIs, databases under
          pressure, infrastructure that requires heroics to keep running.
        </p>
        <p>
          2. <strong>Your team is stuck:</strong> decisions that stall, technical
          debt that nobody owns, engineers firefighting instead of building.
        </p>
        <p>
          3. <strong>You're starting something new:</strong> you want to get the architecture
          right from the beginning.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-block">
      <h2 class="section-title">Why should you trust me?</h2>
      <div class="section-body">
        <p>
          I've been building production software since 1998. Sun Microsystems, a
          global digital agency, and for the past eleven years as co-founder of
          SoftInstigate, the company I started with a partner in 2014.
        </p>
        <p>
          I still write code every day and I live with my architectural
          decisions. RESTHeart, the backend framework I co-created in 2014, is
          running in production at companies across Europe and North America.
          You can look at the code on <a
            href="https://github.com/SoftInstigate"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener">GitHub</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-block">
      <h2 class="section-title">What kind of work do I take on?</h2>
      <div class="section-body">
        <p>
          <strong
            >Architecture reviews, technical leadership, hands-on backend work</strong
          > with Java, MongoDB, AWS, API design. For teams that need a senior engineering
          voice without a full-time hire.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-block">
      <h2 class="section-title">How do I handle AI?</h2>
      <div class="section-body">
        <p>
          AI works best when it is treated as an infrastructure problem. That
          means building it on top of what you already have: your data, your
          processes, your existing systems.
        </p>
        <p>
          The outcome of AI-assisted development depends on the context you
          bring to it: knowing which questions to ask, recognizing when the
          output is wrong, catching architectural mistakes before they compound.
        </p>
        <img
          src="/images/ai-architecture.svg"
          alt="Enterprise AI architecture diagram"
          class="section-figure"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-block">
      <h2 class="section-title">Who have I worked with?</h2>
      <div class="section-body">
        <p>
          A cross-section of engagements across two decades and several
          industries:
        </p>
        <div class="card-grid">
          <div class="surface-card surface-card--compact">
            <p class="card-label card-label--tight">Retail</p>
            <p class="card-text card-text--strong">
              Point-of-sale backend across 2,600 stores and 9,500 terminals.
              Continuous availability, no downtime budget.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="surface-card surface-card--compact">
            <p class="card-label card-label--tight">
              Mobility &amp; public sector
            </p>
            <p class="card-text card-text--strong">
              Traffic data platform integrating 15+ regional and national
              sources. Ten years in production without critical outages.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="surface-card surface-card--compact">
            <p class="card-label card-label--tight">Enterprise content</p>
            <p class="card-text card-text--strong">
              Content platform used by global brands across Europe and North
              America. Core APIs built on RESTHeart.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="surface-card surface-card--compact">
            <p class="card-label card-label--tight">Automotive</p>
            <p class="card-text card-text--strong">
              Marketplace platform for vehicle data and services, integrated
              with national registries and dealer networks.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="surface-card surface-card--compact">
            <p class="card-label card-label--tight">Environmental compliance</p>
            <p class="card-text card-text--strong">
              Architecture review for a national registry system managing
              environmental data for public institutions.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="surface-card surface-card--compact">
            <p class="card-label card-label--tight">Enterprise integration</p>
            <p class="card-text card-text--strong">
              SOA and EAI architecture for large enterprises across the EMEA
              region, including finance and telecommunications.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-block">
      <h2 class="section-title">What do you do next?</h2>
      <div class="section-body">
        <p>Get in touch and we can discuss how to get started.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ContactCta subtext="info@maurizioturatti.com" />
</Base>
